{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A picker allowing to expose several checkboxes and select some of them within the others.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Each checkbox contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose the choosen values using this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem"},{"text":" (divider, read only and error mode, layout and outlined)","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOCheckboxPicker","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tag","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and helper texts and a chekcbox trait.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However if defined in the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISORadioPickerData","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In addition the root item of the picker has for accessiiblity identifier the displayed text."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Forbidden by design","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" in both an error situation and a read only state.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" in both an error situation and a disabled state.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"The design system does not allow to have ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOCheckboxItem","isActive":true},{"text":" in both a read only and a disabled state.","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in checkboxes using MISOCheckboxPickerData.","    \/\/ This object has the same properties as the MISOCheckboxItem,","    \/\/ and some of them are optional with default values set","    var someDataToPopulate: [MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>] {","        [","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_1\",","                                       label: \"Virgin Holy Lava\",","                                       description: \"No alcohol, only tasty flavors\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_2\",","                                       label: \"IPA beer\",","                                       description: \"From Brewdog company\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")),","","        MISOCheckboxPickerData<String>(tag: \"Choice_3\",","                                       label: \"Mineral water\",","                                       image: MISOImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\"))","        ]","    }","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [String] = [\"Choice_1\"] \/\/ or empty if nothing selected","","    \/\/ Here the picker is vertical by default","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections, checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/ The picker can be vertical and have a root item with a label and a counter","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       placement: .verticalRooted(label, .textAndCount))","","    \/\/ The picker can apply some settings to all its radio buttons.","    \/\/ It can be also horizontal with a scroll indicator.","    \/\/ Here all the the checkboxes are in read only mode and use reversed layout.","    \/\/ Here the picker is horizontal and shows the scroll indicator","    MISOCheckboxPicker(selections: $selections,","                       checkboxes: someDataToPopulate)","                       isReversed: true,","                       isReadOnly: true,","                       placement: .horizontal(true))"]},{"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 0.14.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"sections":[],"meta